  "decoder": "vgmstream r2168 (XMA2 and Bink Audio to PCM16)",
  "adaptations": [
    "PCM WAV data retains .ogg resource names because Minecraft 1.11.2 appends .ogg; UiSoundCodec detects RIFF and reads PCM directly.",
    "For bank-only waves, original XAP sample rates replace the packed XMA header rates, and encoder padding is trimmed to XAP source frame counts.",
    "Focus is extracted by event name from the active PS4 Miles bank, with its original BCF1 sample count and native 0.943874..1.059463 pitch range. No resampling, trimming or extra gain/pitch processing is applied to this recording.",
    "Playback averages stereo inputs to mono, then duplicates the mono signal into two output channels to prevent OpenAL positional panning.",
    "Focus playback applies a 32-source-sample stop ramp to reach zero smoothly, adapting Miles DEFAULT_DLRS=32 and SAMPLE.fade_to_stop. Only the final 32 playback frames are affected; the decoded asset, attack/body, rate, length, gain and pitch remain unchanged. This Java adaptation is not a port of the complete closed Miles mixer."
  ]
